- @return_western_menu: Return to Menu
- @1state_visit: Organise a state visit to Luxembourg
- @2versailles: Focus resources towards improving the Luxembourgish opinion of being part of/associated with Germany
- @3sister_party: Support ideologically close parties in Luxembourg
- @4luxger_trade: Support workers unions in Luxembourg, and promote cross-border trade between Luxembourg and Germany

@1state_visit
choose-if: luxembourgish_actions_timer < 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ french_actions_timer +] Weeks until next action
on-arrival: luxembourgish_actions_timer = 1.5; lux_relation += 1; lsap_sv_factor += 0.01 if sfio_in_fr_gov

We have organised a state visit to France and improved relations with their Government

@2versailles
choose-if: luxembourgish_actions_timeractions_timer < 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ french_actions_timer +] Weeks until next action
on-arrival: luxembourgish_actions_timer = 1.5; lux_condominium_negotiation += 1; lux_condominium_annex_negotiation += 1 if lux_condominium_accepted; lux_subject_negotiations += 1 if lux_condominium_annexed; lux_annex_negotiations += 1 if lux_subject; lux_trade += 0.1 if sfio_in_fr_gov

This one is going to take a long time for the player to complete

@3sister_party
choose-if: luxembourgish_actions_timer < 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ french_actions_timer +] Weeks until next action
on-arrival: luxembourgish_actions_timer = 1.5; lux_relation += 1 if sfio_in_fr_gov; lsap_sp_factor += 0.01; prs_lux_sp_factor += 0.01; kpl_sp_factor += 0.01; 

LSAP + RSP are the parties, and also hidden boost to the KPL

@4luxger_trade
choose-if: luxembourgish_actions_timer < 1
unavailable-subtitle: [+ french_actions_timer +] Weeks until next action
on-arrival: luxembourgish_actions_timer = 1.5; lux_ethnicity += 1; lux_trade += 1; lux_relation += 1

